<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Progressive Liberal Party</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1953">1953</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Progressive <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/liberal-party-uk">Liberal Party</a> is a political party of the Bahamas, founded in 1953 to challenge the white merchant elite known as the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bay-street-boys">Bay Street Boys</a>. Under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lynden-pindling">Lynden Pindling</a> it won majority rule in 1967 and led the colony to independence in 1973, governing until 1992. It has since returned to power several times and remains one of the country's two main parties.</p></div>
